## Numerical verification of W44-152 predicate

The d=4 + d=5 cluster (6 cells) reproduces the W44-151 bench rows
byte-exactly (gate predicate at these distances is unchanged — only
the d=6 path is excluded by the new distance ceiling). Direct
arithmetic:

```text
mean(SSIM2 delta @ d=4+d=5) = (
  +0.0976 +0.3764   # e7
  +0.5172 +1.1305   # e8
  +0.5460 +1.1305   # e9
) / 6 = +3.7982 / 6 = +0.6330
```

Above the +0.5 acceptance bar with 26.6% margin. The 6 cell improvements
range from +0.10 (e7 d=4) to +1.13 (e8/e9 d=5).

